WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:14.333
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:31.208
<c.Caption-C6_1>When you feel down

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:34.083
<c.Caption-C7_1>And you are at your wit's end

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:37.833
<c.Caption-C8_1>Ask the Popotan for advice

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<c.Caption-C9_1>Yes, if you can be honest

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.708
<c.Caption-C10_1>And open up your heart

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:48.958
<c.Caption-C11_1>The Popotan will show the way

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.833
<c.Caption-C12_1>Will he come or not?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.541
<c.Caption-C13_1>Does he love me or not?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Is this love true or false?

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:02.208
<c.Caption-C15_1>They have all the answers

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.625
<c.Caption-C16_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:08.416
<c.Caption-C17_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:13.916
<c.Caption-C18_1>I know, but I just can't stop!

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.458
<c.Caption-C19_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.875
<c.Caption-C20_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:24.666
<c.Caption-C21_1>Even if it's just a dream, never give up!

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Wh-Where are we?

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.666
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>I mean, where's our house?

00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:19.708
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>You!

00:02:19.708 --> 00:02:21.458
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>What have you done to Mea?!

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>I've only been following orders.

00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:28.666
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>I was told to bring you here.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.000
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>C-Could that be...?

00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:49.916
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>You must be...!

00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:52.833
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>Miss Shizuka...

00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>...I have brought you the three

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C11_2>as you have asked.

00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:57.916
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Well done.

00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:02.125
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>Good evening, my adorable travellers.

00:03:06.666 --> 00:03:11.625
<c.Caption-C23_1>Farewell

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.375
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Please. I've prepared this for you.

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.208
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Hey! It's better than Mea's tea!

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.500
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Feel free to have more.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.791
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Okay!

00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:41.875
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Look! This isn't about

00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:41.875
<c.Subtitle-C18_2>sitting around drinking tea!

00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:44.583
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>We've been traveling all this time

00:03:41.876 --> 00:03:44.583
<c.Subtitle-C19_2>just to see you!

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:47.083
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>I know that.

00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:50.916
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>You have been traveling across time.

00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:54.416
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>And all such travelers

00:03:51.334 --> 00:03:54.416
<c.Subtitle-C22_2>eventually come here.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>They come to see me and

00:03:55.251 --> 00:03:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C23_2>to begin a new journey.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.625
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>A new journey?

00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:07.875
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Until you arrived here...

00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>...you'd been traveling across

00:04:07.876 --> 00:04:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C26_2>time and space on your journey.

00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:15.375
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>A constant repetition of

00:04:12.834 --> 00:04:15.375
<c.Subtitle-C27_2>meeting and parting.

00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:29.958
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>Meeting many new people

00:04:27.042 --> 00:04:29.958
<c.Subtitle-C28_2>and parting with them.

00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:32.875
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>That's what it means to be

00:04:30.334 --> 00:04:32.875
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>on the journey.

00:04:33.541 --> 00:04:35.875
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>And no matter how hard

00:04:33.542 --> 00:04:35.875
<c.Subtitle-C30_2>it was to part...

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:38.958
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>...you knew that you had to

00:04:35.876 --> 00:04:38.958
<c.Subtitle-C31_2>continue the journey.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:44.166
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>This was the fate you had to live with.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.375
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:48.375 --> 00:04:50.083
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>What fate?

00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:53.208
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>Why is it that we're the ones

00:04:50.084 --> 00:04:53.208
<c.Subtitle-C35_2>who have to live like this?

00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:54.875
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Mai...

00:04:55.208 --> 00:04:58.500
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>If we had just given up on our journey...

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.541
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>...we could've saved ourselves all that grief.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.458
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Then, do you want to stop?

00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:13.666
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>That's why you're here.

00:05:13.666 --> 00:05:16.958
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>This is the place where those who

00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:16.958
<c.Subtitle-C41_2>are exhausted and saddened...

00:05:16.958 --> 00:05:19.958
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>...come to decide whether

00:05:16.959 --> 00:05:19.958
<c.Subtitle-C42_2>they want to continue.

00:05:20.416 --> 00:05:23.166
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>You either continue on your journey...

00:05:23.166 --> 00:05:24.041
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>...or...

00:05:25.041 --> 00:05:26.875
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>...you end it here.

00:05:27.041 --> 00:05:28.666
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>What?!

00:05:28.666 --> 00:05:30.791
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Really?! You mean we really can quit?!

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:35.166
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>If that's what you want

00:05:31.251 --> 00:05:35.166
<c.Subtitle-C48_2>in the bottom of your heart...

00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:40.000
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>...I will deliver you to the place

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:40.000
<c.Subtitle-C49_2>and time that you desire most.

00:05:42.458 --> 00:05:46.125
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>This is a refuge for those who are

00:05:42.459 --> 00:05:46.125
<c.Subtitle-C50_2>exhausted from the journey.

00:05:47.083 --> 00:05:49.125
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Take your time and think about it.

00:05:55.541 --> 00:05:56.625
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Wh-What?!

00:05:57.375 --> 00:05:58.541
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Miss Shizuka?!

00:06:03.416 --> 00:06:07.083
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>The journey so far and the journey ahead...

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.583
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>This is the first fork in the road...

00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:12.791
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>...for those travel weary girls.

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Let's watch over them while they

00:06:13.376 --> 00:06:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C57_2>decide what they will do.

00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:18.666
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>Yes.

00:06:37.791 --> 00:06:39.625
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>Where are we now?

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:41.166
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Don't know?

00:06:41.791 --> 00:06:42.958
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>That's...

00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:51.583
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>Wh-What's our house doing here?!

00:06:52.166 --> 00:06:56.083
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Aww, I don't know what's

00:06:52.167 --> 00:06:56.083
<c.Subtitle-C63_2>going on any more.

00:06:56.958 --> 00:06:58.625
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>I wonder if it was a dream.

00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:02.625
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>It was not a dream.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.375
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>We're going to have to decide

00:07:03.001 --> 00:07:06.375
<c.Subtitle-C66_2>what we're going to do.

00:07:18.416 --> 00:07:21.375
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>So Mai, what are you going to do?

00:07:25.166 --> 00:07:27.083
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>That's an easy one!

00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:28.541
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>I want to quit!

00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:32.333
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>I want to stop this journey and go

00:07:28.709 --> 00:07:32.333
<c.Subtitle-C70_2>to that town where Konami lives!

00:07:32.833 --> 00:07:37.333
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Well, I certainly knew that

00:07:32.834 --> 00:07:37.333
<c.Subtitle-C71_2>Mai would say that.

00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:39.208
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>What about you, Ai?

00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Me?

00:07:41.208 --> 00:07:42.583
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Well, I...

00:07:44.291 --> 00:07:45.791
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Let's see...

00:07:46.416 --> 00:07:49.208
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>There's certainly someone

00:07:46.417 --> 00:07:49.208
<c.Subtitle-C76_2>I'd like to see again.

00:07:49.208 --> 00:07:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>Are you talking about Daichi?

00:07:51.333 --> 00:07:54.416
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>Well, not in a romantic way...

00:07:54.416 --> 00:07:56.958
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>...but rather like a brother.

00:07:57.791 --> 00:08:01.666
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>In that sense, I can't leave him,

00:07:57.792 --> 00:08:01.666
<c.Subtitle-C80_2>just like I can't leave you.

00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:04.166
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>I see.

00:08:04.166 --> 00:08:07.625
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>So, that's two votes for

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:07.625
<c.Subtitle-C82_2>quitting the journey.

00:08:07.833 --> 00:08:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>What about you, Mii?

00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:13.541
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Well, if I could go back somewhere...

00:08:13.541 --> 00:08:16.625
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>...I'd like to see Nono again.

00:08:16.916 --> 00:08:17.916
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>Right.

00:08:17.916 --> 00:08:22.375
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>So it seems like we have a unanimous

00:08:17.917 --> 00:08:22.375
<c.Subtitle-C87_2>decision to quit the journey.

00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:23.333
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>But, you know...

00:08:24.541 --> 00:08:27.291
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>But I want to continue the journey!

00:08:28.291 --> 00:08:33.666
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>I have many, many more friends

00:08:28.292 --> 00:08:33.666
<c.Subtitle-C90_2>besides Nono.

00:08:34.083 --> 00:08:39.750
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>But if I continue, I think I'll be able

00:08:34.084 --> 00:08:39.750
<c.Subtitle-C91_2>to make even more friends.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:43.291
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>That's why I want to

00:08:39.751 --> 00:08:43.291
<c.Subtitle-C92_2>continue on the journey!

00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:44.833
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>Well, unfortunately for you...

00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:48.083
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>...it's two against one,

00:08:44.876 --> 00:08:48.083
<c.Subtitle-C94_2>so we're quitting the journey.

00:08:48.125 --> 00:08:52.125
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>What?! No way! No way!

00:08:48.126 --> 00:08:52.125
<c.Subtitle-C95_2>No way! No way! No way!

00:08:52.166 --> 00:08:53.541
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>You'll have to live with it.

00:08:53.541 --> 00:08:57.416
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>Both Ai and I want to quit the journey

00:08:53.542 --> 00:08:57.416
<c.Subtitle-C97_2>and see special people.

00:08:57.708 --> 00:09:01.916
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>But, but, if we do that, we're all

00:08:57.709 --> 00:09:01.916
<c.Subtitle-C98_2>going to end up separated!

00:09:03.791 --> 00:09:07.166
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>You want to go to where

00:09:03.792 --> 00:09:07.166
<c.Subtitle-C99_2>Konami is, right, Mai?

00:09:07.416 --> 00:09:11.666
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>And you want to go where

00:09:07.417 --> 00:09:11.666
<c.Subtitle-C100_2>puffy cheeks Daichi is, right, Ai?

00:09:11.666 --> 00:09:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>They're both in different

00:09:11.667 --> 00:09:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C101_2>times and places.

00:09:14.541 --> 00:09:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>So we won't be able to live together!

00:09:17.041 --> 00:09:20.625
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>I don't ever, ever want to do that!

00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:23.208
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>I suppose.

00:09:23.791 --> 00:09:26.250
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>To end the journey...

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>...and to go to where we want...

00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:32.458
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>...means the three of us will

00:09:28.959 --> 00:09:32.458
<c.Subtitle-C107_2>have to part ways.

00:09:32.708 --> 00:09:35.500
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>Right? I'm sure neither of you want that.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>It's sad when we leave people

00:09:35.501 --> 00:09:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C109_2>that we're getting to know...

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.333
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>...but it's better than us separating.

00:09:41.333 --> 00:09:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>So, I want to...

00:09:43.083 --> 00:09:44.750
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>No, that's not right.

00:09:45.666 --> 00:09:48.125
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Keith once told me...

00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:51.416
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>...that as we meet people

00:09:48.126 --> 00:09:51.416
<c.Subtitle-C114_2>all over the place...

00:09:51.416 --> 00:09:53.916
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>...we're committing many crimes.

00:09:54.375 --> 00:09:58.541
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>And that we're guilty of causing

00:09:54.376 --> 00:09:58.541
<c.Subtitle-C116_2>so much suffering in the people...

00:09:58.541 --> 00:10:00.500
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>...we leave behind.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.250
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>We should've realized that much sooner.

00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:06.375
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>We're not the only ones that feel sad.

00:10:06.375 --> 00:10:09.875
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>We also make the people

00:10:06.376 --> 00:10:09.875
<c.Subtitle-C120_2>we leave behind just as sad.

00:10:10.916 --> 00:10:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>Have you thought about how

00:10:10.917 --> 00:10:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C121_2>Nono is feeling these days?

00:10:18.125 --> 00:10:21.375
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>If you were to continue on your travels...

00:10:21.375 --> 00:10:22.666
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>...wherever you go...

00:10:22.666 --> 00:10:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>...you mustn't get too close to

00:10:22.667 --> 00:10:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C124_2>other people or make friends...

00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>...or leave fond memories

00:10:26.376 --> 00:10:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C125_2>of yourself in others.

00:10:28.958 --> 00:10:31.166
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>That's the way it'll have to be.

00:10:31.166 --> 00:10:34.750
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Otherwise, we'll be repeating

00:10:31.167 --> 00:10:34.750
<c.Subtitle-C127_2>the same mistakes over and over.

00:10:34.916 --> 00:10:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>Is that okay with you?

00:10:38.708 --> 00:10:43.041
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>In any case, I think we should

00:10:38.709 --> 00:10:43.041
<c.Subtitle-C129_2>each think about this alone.

00:10:54.333 --> 00:10:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Even if we see the same person

00:10:54.334 --> 00:10:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C130_2>or meet someone we like...

00:10:58.083 --> 00:11:00.750
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>...we'll never be able to tell them our story.

00:11:01.458 --> 00:11:04.333
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>It's the same as not being alive!

00:11:04.625 --> 00:11:08.416
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>So we mustn't stop

00:11:04.626 --> 00:11:08.416
<c.Subtitle-C133_2>anyone else from living!

00:11:08.416 --> 00:11:09.458
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>Never!

00:11:10.083 --> 00:11:13.666
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>If we were to quit the journey...

00:11:13.666 --> 00:11:17.000
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>...and repeat the same lives

00:11:13.667 --> 00:11:17.000
<c.Subtitle-C136_2>we've had before...

00:11:17.666 --> 00:11:18.958
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>...I would.

00:11:21.458 --> 00:11:26.000
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>Aww, why do Ai and Mai have to talk

00:11:21.459 --> 00:11:26.000
<c.Subtitle-C138_2>about such difficult things.

00:11:29.541 --> 00:11:33.416
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>If only I could deal with it all with magic.

00:11:39.166 --> 00:11:43.833
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>You sure have it lucky.

00:11:39.167 --> 00:11:43.833
<c.Subtitle-C140_2>It kind of annoys me.

00:11:54.208 --> 00:11:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>Crimes, huh?

00:12:05.041 --> 00:12:08.541
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>I'm sorry, I'm going to have to...

00:12:17.041 --> 00:12:18.125
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>Popotan.

00:12:22.041 --> 00:12:23.125
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Popotan.

00:12:33.791 --> 00:12:35.250
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>Good morning.

00:12:35.291 --> 00:12:38.500
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>Breakfast will be ready soon, okay?

00:12:46.916 --> 00:12:48.750
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>Ow, ow, ow...!

00:12:50.333 --> 00:12:51.250
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>Aww!

00:12:53.125 --> 00:12:55.833
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>Why didn't you wake me up sooner?!

00:12:55.875 --> 00:12:58.958
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>Now I'm totally late! I'm late! I'm late!

00:12:58.958 --> 00:13:01.083
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>Oh, good morning, Mii.

00:13:01.125 --> 00:13:03.500
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>Where are you going in such a rush?

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.833
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Where do you think?

00:13:04.833 --> 00:13:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>School! School!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.750
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>I'm off!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:11.708
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Well, what school are you going to?

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:13.500
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Uh, right.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.041
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>I guess there's no school here.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.166
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>How silly of you.

00:13:20.625 --> 00:13:24.250
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>It just seems kind of strange

00:13:20.626 --> 00:13:24.250
<c.Subtitle-C160_2>hearing you say that.

00:13:25.791 --> 00:13:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>Uh, why are you making breakfast, Ai?

00:13:29.416 --> 00:13:33.000
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>Well, that's because Mea's not here...

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.000
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>...and Mai's not up yet.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.625
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>Then I'll go wake Mai up!

00:13:38.166 --> 00:13:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>Really? Well, thank you.

00:13:42.791 --> 00:13:46.875
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>Now that she's made breakfast,

00:13:42.792 --> 00:13:46.875
<c.Subtitle-C166_2>the more who suffer the better.

00:13:48.208 --> 00:13:49.375
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>Mai!

00:13:49.416 --> 00:13:52.166
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>It's morning! It's time to wake up!

00:13:55.458 --> 00:13:58.708
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>What is this?

00:14:14.958 --> 00:14:17.291
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>Well, why don't you go ahead and eat.

00:14:18.375 --> 00:14:19.375
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Ai!

00:14:20.375 --> 00:14:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Now, now, what's going on?

00:14:22.958 --> 00:14:23.875
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>Look!

00:14:27.208 --> 00:14:28.083
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>This is...!

00:14:28.083 --> 00:14:30.500
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>I can't believe it!

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.166
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>She can't do this!

00:14:32.625 --> 00:14:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>How can she just leave

00:14:32.626 --> 00:14:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C177_2>without saying anything?!

00:14:35.333 --> 00:14:37.041
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>Ai, Mii...

00:14:37.625 --> 00:14:40.083
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>I'm sorry for taking off without telling you.

00:14:40.791 --> 00:14:42.833
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>But I've made my decision.

00:14:43.291 --> 00:14:46.000
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>I've decided to go to where Konami is.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.875
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>It's something that I have to do.

00:14:49.666 --> 00:14:52.708
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>So I've decided to go on my own.

00:14:52.708 --> 00:14:53.708
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>Bye!

00:15:07.291 --> 00:15:08.625
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>You stupid!

00:15:09.166 --> 00:15:10.916
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>You stupid Mai!

00:15:11.166 --> 00:15:12.958
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:15:26.541 --> 00:15:28.041
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>Did you get warmed up?

00:15:29.375 --> 00:15:32.916
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>You were out there in the rain

00:15:29.376 --> 00:15:32.916
<c.Subtitle-C189_2>for a long time.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.958
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>I was worried.

00:15:34.958 --> 00:15:36.250
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>I'm sorry.

00:15:43.958 --> 00:15:45.333
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>What's the matter?

00:15:45.333 --> 00:15:48.458
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>Are you going to go, too?

00:15:50.083 --> 00:15:52.125
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>Uh, of course not!

00:15:52.416 --> 00:15:53.500
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>Liar!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>You're lying, Ai!

00:15:56.416 --> 00:15:58.041
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>I-It's not a lie!

00:15:58.041 --> 00:16:00.708
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>I'm staying with you forever!

00:16:00.875 --> 00:16:01.958
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>It's true!

00:16:01.958 --> 00:16:03.250
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>It's a lie!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.625
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>I know what you want to do!

00:16:05.625 --> 00:16:08.833
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>You want to go to where

00:16:05.626 --> 00:16:08.833
<c.Subtitle-C202_2>puffy cheeks Daichi is!

00:16:10.208 --> 00:16:11.375
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>But...

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:15.291
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>But you're very precious to me.

00:16:15.291 --> 00:16:18.291
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>I'm going to stay with you, Mii.

00:16:18.666 --> 00:16:21.541
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>I don't mind if we continue our journey...

00:16:21.541 --> 00:16:24.666
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>...and I'm willing to go

00:16:21.542 --> 00:16:24.666
<c.Subtitle-C207_2>where you want to go.

00:16:24.875 --> 00:16:26.875
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>I really feel that way!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.583
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>But that's...

00:16:29.041 --> 00:16:31.208
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>But that's a problem for me.

00:16:32.541 --> 00:16:34.041
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>Wh-Why?

00:16:34.041 --> 00:16:37.583
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>You're not being honest

00:16:34.042 --> 00:16:37.583
<c.Subtitle-C212_2>with your own feelings.

00:16:37.583 --> 00:16:39.625
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>All for the sake of me.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.875
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>I don't think it'll be fun travelling

00:16:39.751 --> 00:16:43.875
<c.Subtitle-C214_2>with you if that's how you feel.

00:16:44.291 --> 00:16:46.208
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>That wouldn't make me happy!

00:16:46.833 --> 00:16:47.708
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>Mii!

00:16:50.125 --> 00:16:51.125
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>Mii...

00:17:00.166 --> 00:17:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>Mii, I'm sorry about before.

00:17:03.458 --> 00:17:06.625
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>Could I talk to you about something?

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:07.708
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>Mii?

00:17:07.875 --> 00:17:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>Are you already asleep?

00:17:10.166 --> 00:17:11.083
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>No!

00:17:11.083 --> 00:17:12.083
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>Mii?!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.000
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>It can't be...

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.083
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>Why...

00:17:28.666 --> 00:17:30.666
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>Why is everyone...?

00:17:37.041 --> 00:17:38.291
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>Ai!

00:17:39.333 --> 00:17:43.583
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>I'm really sorry about before, Ai.

00:17:44.583 --> 00:17:46.916
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>And thank you.

00:17:47.625 --> 00:17:52.000
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>I really appreciate how

00:17:47.626 --> 00:17:52.000
<c.Subtitle-C230_2>you feel about me.

00:17:52.625 --> 00:17:58.625
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>But I don't want you to

00:17:52.626 --> 00:17:58.625
<c.Subtitle-C231_2>feel sad because of me.

00:17:58.625 --> 00:18:02.458
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>That's why I'm going to where Nono is!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:06.333
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>And you should go where

00:18:02.751 --> 00:18:06.333
<c.Subtitle-C233_2>puffy cheeks Daichi is!

00:18:07.708 --> 00:18:08.750
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>So!

00:18:09.708 --> 00:18:13.291
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>Picohan Magical Parallel Magical!

00:18:13.708 --> 00:18:17.083
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>I wish you great happiness in your life!

00:18:21.458 --> 00:18:22.875
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>Mii...

00:18:50.416 --> 00:18:52.416
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>Come, Unagi.

00:19:01.125 --> 00:19:03.958
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>This place is too big for the two of us.

00:19:04.125 --> 00:19:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>Aww, no matter how I work the numbers,

00:19:04.126 --> 00:19:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C240_2>we're totally in the red!

00:19:09.583 --> 00:19:13.333
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>Maybe running a Christmas shop

00:19:09.584 --> 00:19:13.333
<c.Subtitle-C241_2>wasn't the way to go.

00:19:21.208 --> 00:19:25.708
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>She's a Magical Girl and

00:19:21.209 --> 00:19:25.708
<c.Subtitle-C242_2>she's got "Puffy" in her name!

00:19:25.708 --> 00:19:28.375
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>You just watch! I won't lose to you!

00:19:28.791 --> 00:19:32.083
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>Picohan Magical Parallel Magical!

00:19:52.041 --> 00:19:54.333
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>Thank you for everything.

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:10.625
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>Have you decided?

00:20:10.625 --> 00:20:11.625
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>Yes.

00:20:11.625 --> 00:20:15.000
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>And I did have a lot of things to say to you.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>Let's hear them.

00:20:17.083 --> 00:20:19.875
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>But I've decided not to tell you.

00:20:19.875 --> 00:20:23.208
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>It has nothing to do with

00:20:19.876 --> 00:20:23.208
<c.Subtitle-C251_2>my future, after all.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:47.541
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>Hello.

00:20:47.541 --> 00:20:49.541
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>You're the last of the travelers.

00:20:49.958 --> 00:20:52.291
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>Where's Mai and Mii?

00:20:52.833 --> 00:20:55.583
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>I took them to where they desired to go.

00:20:55.791 --> 00:20:59.333
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>I'm sure they're having

00:20:55.792 --> 00:20:59.333
<c.Subtitle-C256_2>a wonderful time right now.

00:20:59.583 --> 00:21:01.083
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>I see.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.083
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>Well, goodbye.

00:21:17.291 --> 00:21:19.125
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>Have a good trip.

00:21:35.125 --> 00:21:41.041
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>Whether this was the right thing to do

00:21:35.126 --> 00:21:41.041
<c.Subtitle-C260_2>or not was completely up to them.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.958
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>The path that they themselves have chosen.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>The journey does carry on, after all.

00:22:11.916 --> 00:22:15.333
<c.Caption-C24_1>I want to love you in technopunk

00:22:15.333 --> 00:22:18.708
<c.Caption-C25_1>I transmit my love through the airwaves

00:22:18.708 --> 00:22:22.250
<c.Caption-C26_1>I want to be romantic with you

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:23.791
<c.Caption-C27_1>I want you to laugh

00:22:23.791 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C28_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:29.000
<c.Caption-C29_1>S.U.K.I. Thump thump love

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:32.500
<c.Caption-C30_1>S.U.K.I. Gimme gimme kiss

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:36.000
<c.Caption-C31_1>S.U.K.I. Suki suki love

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:39.625
<c.Caption-C32_1>S.U.K.I. You love me? Kiss

00:22:39.625 --> 00:22:41.375
<c.Caption-C33_1>Round and round

00:22:41.375 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C34_1>The needle of the time-space clock

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C35_1>Points to our star charts

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.916
<c.Caption-C36_1>The secret of love is revealed

00:22:49.916 --> 00:22:54.541
<c.Caption-C37_1>I want to know more about

00:22:49.917 --> 00:22:54.541
<c.Caption-C37_2>what makes my heart go thump thump

00:22:56.791 --> 00:23:01.416
<c.Caption-C38_1>If every boy and every girl

00:22:56.792 --> 00:23:01.416
<c.Caption-C38_2>believed in miracles

00:23:03.625 --> 00:23:08.375
<c.Caption-C39_1>We'd be sure to find

00:23:03.626 --> 00:23:08.375
<c.Caption-C39_2>the berry, berry strawberry day

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C40_1>I'll be fine even if we have to

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C40_2>say goodbye one day

00:23:16.791 --> 00:23:21.500
<c.Caption-C41_1>I still want to tell you just how I love you

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.666
<c.Caption-C42_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:26.083 --> 00:23:30.500
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.208 --> 00:23:44.875
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.125 --> 00:24:03.166
<c.Caption-C43_1>Popotan

00:23:47.041 --> 00:23:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>Okay, so this is the last

00:23:47.042 --> 00:23:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C265_2>episode preview that I'll do.

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:54.166
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>In the end, my only speaking

00:23:50.751 --> 00:23:54.166
<c.Subtitle-C266_2>parts were the previews.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.583
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>I guess there's no point in sulking.

00:23:57.583 --> 00:23:59.875
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>I'm going to go out in a blaze of glory!

00:24:00.125 --> 00:24:01.791
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>The final episode is "Popotan".

00:24:01.791 --> 00:24:03.500
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>Make sure you don't miss it!

00:24:07.791 --> 00:24:09.916
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>Good night, everyone!
